p-inflation.html'&gt;韩国加息至两年来最高水平，通胀仍高于目标&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Korea upgrades growth forecast, raises benchmark rates to highest in two years&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/bok-rate-decision-korea-gdp-inflation.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:50:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>万斯表示，他确信黄仁勋没有受到司法部调查</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/vance-jensen-huang-nvidia-doj-investigation.html</link><description>特朗普政府是否调查黄仁勋潜在的国家安全风险一直是人们质疑的话题。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/vance-jensen-huang-nvidia-doj-investigation.html'&gt;万斯表示，他确信黄仁勋没有受到司法部调查&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Vance says he was assured Jensen Huang was not under DOJ investigation&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/vance-jensen-huang-nvidia-doj-investigation.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:00:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于投资者权衡美国新关税，亚太市场开盘低迷</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html</link><description>在华尔街隔夜从盘中低点大幅反弹后，亚太市场周四开盘走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [CNBC] &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html'&gt;由于投资者权衡美国新关税，亚太市场开盘低迷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Korea's Kospi leads gains as tech rebound lifts Asia markets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/stock-markets-today-.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:45:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>